                  <value>
                     <exData contentType="text/html" xliff:rid="5842A20E-71EF-4EC9-A447-10BF57616DCF">
                        <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/"><p style="font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in">Important note :-</p><p style="font-weight:bold;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in">01. For queries related to this invoice - Please contact: UMA Lease Administration Department, Tel:(013) 898 9999 Ext. 2808, Fax: (013) 893 6000 , Email: mhaseeb@uma.com.sa</p><p style="font-weight:bold;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in">02. Please pay to Universal Motors Agencies Company Limited</p><p style="font-weight:bold;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in">03. Evidence of all charge(s), other than the monthly rent, is(are) accompanied with this invoice</p><p style="font-weight:bold;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in">04. Before terminating any vehicle (either early or normally) please inform us thru letter addressed to the undersigned or by email at mhaseeb@uma.com.sa or fax at (013) 893 6000 {No verbal request(s) will be entertained}</p><p style="font-weight:bold;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in">05. Any amount (Rental, Additional Charges, Deduction and/or Credit) if not covered in this invoice will be adjusted in the subsequent invoice(s)</p><p style="text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"><span style="xfa-spacerun:yes">          </span></p></body>
                     </exData>
                  </value>
                  <font baselineShift="0pt" size="6.5pt" typeface="Arial"/>
                  <margin bottomInset="0.5mm" leftInset="0.5mm" rightInset="0.5mm" topInset="1.7702mm"/>
